    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote4" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The management of the business and affairs of Cactus II Pipeline LLC ("the Company") is fully vested in the Members. To facilitate the management of the Company, the Members as as a "committee of the whole" referred to as the "Board." Each Member has appointed one Manager to the Board. The Designated Managers are listed on pages 104 &amp; 105.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value4" xlink:to="footnote4" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="4" />
